 "posts": [
  "CONGRATULATIONS, SIR ROEL Z. CASTRO!\nNegros Power congratulates Sir Roel Z. Castro on being recognized as the Circle of Excellence Awardee – CEO of the Year at the 17th Asia CEO Awards 2026.\nThis recognition reflects his leadership and commitment to advancing the energy sector. Under his leadership, Primelectric continues to pursue initiatives that strengthen electricity distribution and improve service for the communities it serves.\nAs part of the Primelectric group, Negros Power joins in celebrating this significant achievement and looks forward to continuing its commitment to reliable service and community development.\nCongratulations, Sir Roel, on this well-deserved recognition!"
 ],
